WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,480
Grandma Jiang Captain Qi

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,360
Are you planning to go to the hotel too?

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,560
Can you take my two little grandsons with you?

4
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,760
I still have a few second-level gold boxes here

5
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,120
It was left behind by my son

6
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,520
I have been hiding it and not daring to spend it.

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,760
If you don't mind, take them all

8
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,320
I just ask you to take care of my two little grandsons

9
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,320
Take it to the hotel. Grandma Jiang, get up quickly. This can't be done.

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:24,340
I still have to discuss this matter with my teammates and I can’t make the decision myself. What do you think?

11
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,860
Do you want to bring Grandma Jiang with you? She also has two grandchildren.

12
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,100
If you stay here, you can only slowly wait for death. I agree to take him with you.

13
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,020
The eldest brother of the Jiang family saved the lives of our siblings before.

14
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:36,820
I don't care what you two say about Wang Xuewei and Wang Xiang.

15
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:40,020
I can only say that I tried my best to protect Qi Heng.

16
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,420
You have to talk to them first

17
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:42,660
Don't yell or scream on the road

18
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:47,140
Did you hear Grandma Jiang that no one would save her if she caused loss?
